### Check common causes > MCP server configuration

Source: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/debug-your-config

Project MCP configuration must be placed at the repository root as .mcp.json, not inside .claude/ or in Claude Desktop's config format. MCP servers added under mcpServers in settings.json will not load because settings.json does not read an mcpServers key.

