### Where servers are saved > Find your configuration on disk

Source: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/mcp-quickstart

Server configurations are stored based on their scope: `local` scope entries are found in `~/.claude.json` under the project's entry, `project` scope entries are in `.mcp.json` within your project root, and `user` scope entries are in `~/.claude.json` under the top-level `mcpServers` key. Knowing these locations can assist with debugging and version control.

### Configure Bash Wildcard Permissions

Source: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/permissions

